I would also distinguish between constitutional invariants and derived requirements.

For example:

INV-004
Evidence precedes inference.

From this invariant follow implementation requirements such as:

REQ-PROV-021
Every inference SHALL reference one or more Evidence objects.
REQ-VAL-014
Validation SHALL reject inferences without evidence.
